      "text": "finite proxy for human preference. Among recent surveys, Kaufmann et al. [2025] provide\na broad map of RLHF across domains, Chaudhari et al. [2024] focus on reward-model\nmisspecification in LLM alignment, and Liu et al. [2026] emphasize preference learning,\nuncertainty quantification, and statistical inference.\n",
