    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.00155_p37_b4",
      "text": "Over-optimization and mitigation strategies.\nThe empirical evidence is now fairly\nsystematic. Gao et al. [2023] document the canonical proxy-versus-gold divergence in\n",
